		"content":"<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a name=\"_Toc21786\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">陕西银河煤业开发有限公司井下主排水系统高压配电柜及软启动柜智能化改造项目(N2标段)招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（项目编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">YSMD-2026-01020246）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Toc13398\"></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1.招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">陕西银河煤业开发有限公司井下主排水系统高压配电柜及软启动柜智能化改造项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">(N2标段)</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">/核准/备案机关批准，招标人为</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">陕西</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">榆林能源集团榆神煤电有限公司</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">，建设资金来源为自筹，出资比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">100%，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">自愿</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">公开招标</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">，特邀有意愿的投标人参加投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Toc15626\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2.项目概况与招标范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2.1服务地点：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">榆林市榆阳区金鸡滩镇上河村</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2.2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">项目规模</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">及</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">招标范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">井下主排水系统高压配电柜及软启动柜智能化改造项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">(N2标段)</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">计划对盘区变电所高压软启动柜进行智能化升级改造；具体范围和服务工作内容详见招标文件第</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">五</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">章技术规范书；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">供</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">货</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">期</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">45日历天内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2.4标段名称</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">陕西银河煤业开发有限公司井下主排水系统高压配电柜及软启动柜智能化改造项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">(N2标段)；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Toc29827\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1投标人须具备独立法人资格，提供合法有效的营业执照，具备提供本次货物的制造厂商</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.2投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">须具有并提供所投产品有效期内的《矿用产品安全标志证书》（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">MA）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标人须提供自</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2023年1月1日至投标截止之日(以</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">合同签订</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">时间为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">10KV防爆</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">高压软启动柜</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">供货业绩</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1份。（提供合同复印件</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">合同内容应包括首页、签字盖章页、供货内容页等关键信息；</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">提供发票，发票清晰可查验，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">对于提供合同或证明不清晰、信息不全，字体有明显修改等现象，视为无效业绩；）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">财务要求：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">赋码后的</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2025年财务审计报告</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（至少提供经审计的资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）、所有者权益变动表等资料扫描件。）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）可查询；成立时间至提交响应文件截止时间不足一年的可提供成立后其基本存款账户出具的资信证明；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标人没有处于被责令停业，财产没有被接管、冻结状态</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">没有受到有关行政执法部门处罚暂停或取消投标资格（黑名单）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">投标人不得列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/xinyongfuwu/shixinheimingdan/）严重失信主体名单；</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">不得在中国裁判文书网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">http://wenshu.court.gov.cn/）近三年（202</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1日至今）有行贿犯罪记录</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">（被执行人包括投标人、法定代表人）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3.7</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Toc22663\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">4.资格审查方法</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Toc20386\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">5.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Toc31118\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">5.1获取时间</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">15</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">21</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">分（北京时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">5.2获取方式</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本项目通过榆能集团电子采购交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">https://dzsw.sxylny.com/(建议使用谷歌浏览器)提供投标人注册CA证书、获取招标文件、上传投标文件、澄清说明和补正等功能。未在平台注册的投标人须访问榆能集团电子采购交易平台https://dzsw.sxylny.com完成注册、办理CA证书等有关操作,具体操作步骤详见平台首页-服务专区：供应商注册手册，供应商操作手册(榆能集团电子采购交易平台客服电话400-855-8505(转1))。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">5.3 CA证书的办理：办理CA证书的供应商方可完成项目获取、投标等操作，办理CA证书需2-3个工作日，请供应商提前办理，以免影响正常投标，CA证书收费标准及办理流程详见平台首页&gt;服务中心&gt;&gt;平台规则中附件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">5.4平台技术服务费收取：中标人须向平台运营商按如下标准和规定缴纳平台技术服务费：平台技术服务费不区分货物、服务和工程类别，收费标准以中标金额为计费基数，执行定额收费标准，具体缴费流程及收费标准详见平台首页-&gt;服务中心-&gt;平台规则中平台技术服务费-收费细则。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">6.投标文件的递交：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">6.1投标文件递交的截止时间：202</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">9</span>